&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Registration Number: &lt;/b&gt;{!Get_deal_record.Name} 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Deal Registration Name: &lt;/b&gt;{!Get_deal_record.Core_Design_Registration_Nm__c}
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;End Customer Account: &lt;/b&gt;{!Get_deal_record.Core_End_Customer_Account_Id__r.Name}  
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Opportunity: &lt;/b&gt; Click &lt;a href=https://intel--crmdevsls3.sandbox.lightning.force.com/{!Get_deal_record.Core_Opportunity_Id__c}&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to view
&lt;br&gt;
{!table}
&lt;br&gt;
If you have requested a financial incentive, you will receive a seperate notification regarding your request.
&lt;br&gt;
For more details, you can access the opportunity record &lt;a href=https://intel--crmdevsls3.sandbox.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Opportunity/{!Get_deal_record.Core_Opportunity_Id__c}&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;br&gt;
This email was sent from an unmonitored mailbox. For questions,please contact your Intel Partner Sales Account Manager or utilize the Chatter feature on the Opportunity.
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
It is the Intel Partner&apos;s responsibility to understand the export, customs and sanction controls applicable to the Intel Partner&apos;s company, project, and product and take all actions necessary to ensure compliance.
&lt;/p&gt;
