&lt;td style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-word-wrap: break-word; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;row collapse header&quot; style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; display: table; border-collapse: collapse; position: relative; border-spacing: 0; background-color: #0071c5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;small-12 large-12 columns first last&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; width: 680px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;row header-content&quot; style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; display: table; border-collapse: collapse; position: relative; border-spacing: 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;mobile-padding small-12 large-12 columns first last&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px 20px; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 17.39px;padding-top: 25px;text-align: left;color: #fefefe;line-height: 1.3;font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 400;border-collapse: collapse !important;-ms-word-break: keep-all;-ms-word-wrap: normal;-ms-hyphens: none;-moz-hyphens: none;-webkit-hyphens: none;hyphens: none;&quot;&gt;Deal Registration Approved&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;callout-inner&quot; style=&quot;padding:15px;&quot;&gt; 
&lt;img src=https://intel--c.na104.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153b000004Pg4i&amp;amp;oid=00Do0000000aRcf alt=&quot;Intel&quot; title=&quot;Intel&quot; align=&quot;right&quot; class=&quot;float-center&quot; style=&quot;height:100%;width:auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;expander&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px !important; width: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;spacer&quot; style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; background-color: #f3f3f3;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td height=&quot;10&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 10px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-word-wrap: break-word; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;row module full-width&quot; style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; display: table; border-collapse: collapse; position: relative; border-spacing: 0; background-color: #fefefe;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;small-12 large-12 columns first last&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 20px 10px; width: 650px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; background-color: #fefefe;&quot;&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
 Hello {!Get_deal_record.Owner:User.Name},
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;&quot;&gt;  
The following Deal Registraion has been &lt;b&gt;Approved.&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Registration Number: &lt;/b&gt;{!Get_deal_record.Name} 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Deal Registration Name: &lt;/b&gt;{!Get_deal_record.Core_Design_Registration_Nm__c}
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;End Customer Account: &lt;/b&gt;{!Get_deal_record.Core_End_Customer_Account_Id__r.Name}  
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Opportunity: &lt;/b&gt; Click &lt;a href=https://intel--crmdevsls3.sandbox.my.site.com/partneradmin/s/opportunity/{!Get_deal_record.Core_Opportunity_Id__c}&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to view
&lt;br&gt;
{!table}
&lt;br&gt;
If you have requested a financial incentive, you will receive a seperate notification regarding your request.
&lt;br&gt;
For more details, you can access the opportunity record &lt;a href=https://intel--crmdevsls3.sandbox.my.site.com/partneradmin/s/opportunity/{!Get_deal_record.Core_Opportunity_Id__c}&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;br&gt;
This email was sent from an unmonitored mailbox. For questions,please contact your Intel Partner Sales Account Manager or utilize the Chatter feature on the Opportunity.
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
It is the Intel Partner&apos;s responsibility to understand the export, customs and sanction controls applicable to the Intel Partner&apos;s company, project, and product and take all actions necessary to ensure compliance.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;remove-absolute&quot; style=&quot;display: block;&quot; elqid=&quot;8645&quot; elqtype=&quot;DynamicContent&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;

